          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the n(ame of the Merciful)</li>\n<li>List of the R\u016bm [&hellip;] and 3/4 wayba[s]</li>\n<li>the proselyte 3 ways his slave girl Mub\u0101raka 1/2 wayb(a)</li>\n<li>Mena\u1e25em 1/2 wayba Ma[\u1e25]\u0101sina 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>the wife of Avraham the [&hellip;] [1/]2 wayba [&hellip;] 1[/]2 [way]ba</li>\n<li>the wife of the blind man 1/2 wayba Natan 1/2 wayb[a]</li>\n<li>Eliakim 1/2 wayba Shemarya 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>Umm Matatya 1/2 Shelomit 1/4 wayba</li>\n<li>[al-]Faris\u012bn\u012b 1/2 wayba the goldsmith 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>[&hellip;] 3/4 wayba Qal\u012bna 3/4 wayba</li>\n<li>[al-]Q\u0101l.q\u016br\u012b 3/4 wayba Umm Senior 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>Shil\u1e25iy\u0101 one wayba Sara 1/2 wayba // and her husband //<del> Mush</del> Moshe 1/4</li>\n<li>Yehudah 1/4 wayba Shemarya 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>Yehudah 3/4 wayba Ab\u016b M\u012bkh\u0101\u02be\u012bl one wayba</li>\n<li>[&hellip;] 1/4 the mother of the captive 1/4 wayba</li>\n<li>[&hellip;] 1/2 wayba <del>Elia</del> b. Isr\u0101\u02be\u012bl 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>Ni[s]an 1/2 wayba Umm Kh\u016blia 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li><del>Umm Abu&rsquo;l-Mun\u0101 1/4 wayba</del> Yehudah one wayba</li>\n<li>Ibrahim 1/4 wayba</li>\n<li>&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;-</li>\n<li>[Yi\u1e63]\u1e25aq one wayba Shemarya 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>al-[&hellip;] 1/4 wayba <del>\u1e24as\u016bna 1/4 wayba</del></li>\n<li>Moshe the lame 1/2 wayba Qar\u02bfa 1/4 wayba</li>\n<li><del>the Maghrebi elder 1/4 wayba</del> Shelomo the scribe 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfq\u016bb of R\u016bm 1/4 wayba</li>\n<li>the mother-in-law of Natan 1/4 wayba the uncle of Natan 1/4</li>\n<li>the mother-in-law of El[iyy]ahu 1/2 wayba Shimon of R\u016bm 1/4</li>\n<li><del>Eliyyahu 1/2 wayba</del> Eliyyahu 1/2 wayba</li>\n<li>a dyer from R\u016bm 1/2 wayba the errand boy of &ldquo;<i>the Segullat</i>&rdquo; 1/4</li></ol>\n",
